  "goodToKnow": "Moderieren means to host or present a TV or radio programme, or to moderate a discussion: eine Sendung moderieren, eine Podiumsdiskussion moderieren. Der Moderator (die Moderatorin) is a presenter or host; die Moderation is the presenting, or moderation of an online forum. Moderat means moderate, as in moderate prices. Like all -ieren verbs, it forms the perfect without ge-: hat moderiert."
